# Redirect list for recurforge.com.
#
# A published article never changes category: the category is part of its
# address. If one ever has to move, the old address gets a 301 here on the same
# commit that moves the file — never later.
#
# Format, one rule per line:
#   /blog/<old-category>/<slug>/   /blog/<new-category>/<slug>/   301
#
# Render does not read this file by itself. It is the source of truth for the
# rules; each one also has to be entered once in the Render dashboard under
# Settings → Redirects and Rewrites. Keeping the list here means the next
# person can see what exists without logging in.
#
# No redirects yet.
